## Overview

This extension was generated by the CAST Extension Generator for **{{LANGUAGE}}**. It provides automatic object detection based on regex patterns you defined in `config_input.json`.

> **Critical Understanding:**
> - ✅ **Pass 1 (Object Detection)** is FULLY IMPLEMENTED and works out-of-the-box
> - ❌ **Pass 2 (Link Detection - Same Technology)** contains EMPTY SKELETONS that you must implement
> - ❌ **Application Level (Cross-Technology Links)** contains EMPTY SKELETONS that you must implement
> - Without implementing Pass 2, you will have objects but NO LINKS within {{LANGUAGE}} code
> - Without implementing Application Level, you will have NO LINKS to other technologies (Java, SQL, etc.)

---

## What This Extension Does Automatically

### ✅ Pass 1: Object Detection (Fully Implemented)

The extension automatically:
- **Detects** all code structures defined in your configuration
- **Creates** CAST objects (Classes, Functions, Methods, etc.)
- **Builds** object hierarchy (parent-child relationships)
- **Enables** F11 source navigation to code
- **Registers** all objects in a global symbol table

**This works immediately after deployment - no coding required.**

