## Technical Details

### Architecture

```
{{LANGUAGE}}AnalyzerExtension (analyser_level)
    ├─ Pass 1: Object Detection (AUTOMATIC)
    │   ├─ Read source files
    │   ├─ Apply regex patterns
    │   ├─ Extract code structures
    │   ├─ Create CAST objects
    │   └─ Build symbol table
    │
    └─ Pass 2: Link Detection (MANUAL IMPLEMENTATION REQUIRED)
        ├─ full_parse() → Detect calls (YOU implement)
        ├─ resolve() → Resolve targets (YOU implement)
        └─ save_links() → Create links (skeleton provided)

{{LANGUAGE}}ApplicationExtension (application_level)
    └─ Cross-Technology Links (MANUAL IMPLEMENTATION REQUIRED)
        └─ end_application() → Link to other technologies (YOU implement)

{{LANGUAGE}}Library
    ├─ Global symbol table (all objects)
    ├─ Name-based lookup (symbols_by_name)
    └─ Multi-file coordination

{{LANGUAGE}}Module
    ├─ File-level parsing
    ├─ Object hierarchy construction
    └─ Link tracking (pending_links)
```

### Processing Flow

```
1. CAST runs all Analyzer-Level extensions
   ├─ Java Analyzer creates Java objects
   ├─ SQL Analyzer creates database objects
   └─ {{LANGUAGE}} Analyzer creates {{LANGUAGE}} objects
        ├─ Pass 1: Object Detection (automatic)
        └─ Pass 2: Same-technology links (you implement)

2. CAST runs all Application-Level extensions
   └─ {{LANGUAGE}} Application Extension
        └─ Cross-technology links (you implement)
             ├─ {{LANGUAGE}} → Java
             ├─ {{LANGUAGE}} → SQL
             └─ {{LANGUAGE}} → Other technologies

3. CAST builds final knowledge base
   └─ All objects + all links available in CAST Imaging
```

